<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Flat solid play/pause button — replaces the old rainbow gradient ring
     + glow bloom. A plain brand_primary-filled circle, no border, no
     shadow, no gradient — matches the rest of this screen's flat, minimal
     redesign instead of standing out as the one loud multicolor element. -->
